#created by Duel Circuit - No Limits: K9 Vanquish Soul, late 2025 (Augie "Noroi")
#title K9 Vanquish Soul (2025, uncut)
#era 2025
#tier No Limits peak build: pool (docs/dev/NO-LIMITS-SPEC-2026-11-02.md section 5)
#about Won YCS Bologna (November 2025, 2,429 players), between its world title in August and its two 300th-YCS wins in February. Vanquish Soul reveals cards for quick effects on both turns; three K9-04 Noroi and the K9 Xyz package add disruption from the hand. Here with three Razen and three Stake your Soul! again, and the old hand-peek cards beside the hounds.
#why Peak list: November 2025; restored: K9-04 Noroi x3, Vanquish Soul Razen x3, Stake your Soul! x3, Vanquish Soul Hollie Sue x3, K9-66a Jokul x3, "A Case for K9" x3; picks: Confiscation, Trap Dustshoot, Outer Entity Azathot (Extra); cuts: Mulcharmy Fuwalos x2 (flex), Number C104: Umbral Horror Masquerade (Extra). Measured 2026-11-03: rated 1763 (+90 over k9-vanquish-soul 1673).
